00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:25.000
So our idea here is
to democratize data

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:31.100
and to make it readily available
to all Iron Mountain employees.

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:36.070
But we do have to consider
specific things from a data

00:05:36.070 --> 00:05:39.330
