00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:40.780
And then the other
part of this is

00:05:40.780 --> 00:05:44.610
it's a big cultural
change for us, as well.

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:48.470
So the company wasn't
used to thinking this way.

00:05:48.470 --> 00:05:50.720
So what we wanted
to do is to start

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:57.280
to show the entire company
that this type of thinking

00:05:57.280 --> 00:06:01.930
and efforts can happen
quickly and pretty seamlessly.

00:06:01.930 --> 00:06:05.750
We adopted an agile
mindset, and we

00:06:05.750 --> 00:06:07.430
