to collect data

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:12.020
from different countries and
different operational systems

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:14.360
and start to land
it into the cloud.

00:06:14.360 --> 00:06:18.020
And then as well, we partnered
with SpringML with Looker

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:23.000
and with Google in order to
build out those dashboards.

